-| Premine | ${SUBSIDY / ATOM} KVNC (founder / treasury) |
-| Subsidy cap | ${SUBSIDY / ATOM} KVNC / block, halves every ${HALVING_ERA} blocks |
+| Premine | ${FOUNDER_AMOUNT / ATOM} KVNC (founder) + ${TREASURY_AMOUNT / ATOM} KVNC (treasury vaults) |
+| Subsidy | ${SUBSIDY / ATOM} KVNC / block at genesis, geometric decay (alpha=3/4) every ${ERA_LENGTH} blocks |
